ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":10,"created_at":"2025-07-30T14:32:31Z","updated_at":"2025-10-23T16:09:57Z","closed_at":"2025-10-23T16:09:35Z","assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5 beta.4\n- Not reproducible in 4.5 beta.3\n\n### System information\n\n-\n\n### Issue description\n\nOverriding the `_log_message()` method and printing something within it will not show up in output, but will show up in the console.\n\n<img width=\"1739\" height=\"934\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a592c61e-7e87-4e8e-879c-900527170bec\" />\n\n<img width=\"1630\" height=\"937\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5748552a-36d9-414b-8970-e0e642f7b07d\" />\n\nI assume it's a kind of circular reference situation thing.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nDownload the MRP, or simply create a new project with a custom logger class that prints the messages like so:\n\n```GDScript\nextends Logger\n\n\nfunc _log_error(function: String, file: String, line: int, code: String, rationale: String, editor_notify: bool, error_type: int, script_backtraces: Array[ScriptBacktrace]) -> void:\n\tprint_rich(\"[color=red][i]New error:\\n\\tfunction: %s\\n\\tfile: %s\\n\\tline: %s\\n\\tcode: %s\\n\\trationale: %s\\n\\teditor_notify: %s\\n\\terror_type: %s\\n\\tscript_backtraces: %s[/i][/color]\" % [\n\t\tfunction, file, line, code, rationale, editor_notify, error_type, script_backtraces\n\t])\n\n\nfunc _log_message(message: String, error: bool) -> void:\n\tprint_rich(\"[color=yellow][i]New message: %s\\n\\tis_error: %s[/i][/color]\" % [message.trim_suffix(\"\\n\"), error])\n```\nRegister it via `OS.add_logger()` and test.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[logger.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21511466/logger.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/